[
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_181",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
      "math_alg_polynomials"
    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Let $P(x) = x^3 - ax^2 + bx + 5$. When $P(x)$ is divided by $x-1$, the remainder is 2. When $P(x)$ is divided by $x+1$, the remainder is 2. Find the values of $a$ and $b$.",
    "question_zh": "設 $P(x) = x^3 - ax^2 + bx + 5$。當 $P(x)$ 除以 $x-1$ 時，餘數為 2。當 $P(x)$ 除以 $x+1$ 時，餘數為 2。求 $a$ 及 $b$ 的值。",
    "options": [
      "A. $a=3, b=-1$",
      "B. $a=3, b=1$",
      "C. $a=-3, b=-1$",
      "D. $a=-3, b=1$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "By Remainder Theorem: $P(1) = 1 - a + b + 5 = 6 - a + b = 2 \\Rightarrow a - b = 4$.",
      "$P(-1) = -1 - a - b + 5 = 4 - a - b = 2 \\Rightarrow a + b = 2$.",
      "Summing the equations: $2a = 6 \\Rightarrow a = 3$.",
      "Subtracting the equations: $2b = -2 \\Rightarrow b = -1$.",
      "Final Answer: $a=3, b=-1$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "根據餘數定理：$P(1) = 1 - a + b + 5 = 6 - a + b = 2 \\Rightarrow a - b = 4$。",
      "$P(-1) = -1 - a - b + 5 = 4 - a - b = 2 \\Rightarrow a + b = 2$。",
      "兩式相加：$2a = 6 \\Rightarrow a = 3$。",
      "兩式相減：$2b = -2 \\Rightarrow b = -1$。",
      "最後答案：$a=3, b=-1$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_182",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
      "math_alg_quadratics"
    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "If the quadratic equation $x^2 - (k+2)x + (2k+1) = 0$ has equal roots, find the possible value(s) of $k$.",
    "question_zh": "若二次方程 $x^2 - (k+2)x + (2k+1) = 0$ 有等根，求 $k$ 的可能值。",
    "options": [
      "A. 0 or 4",
      "B. 1 or 4",
      "C. 0 or 8",
      "D. 2 or 6"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "For equal roots, Discriminant $\\Delta = 0$.",
      "$\\Delta = [-(k+2)]^2 - 4(1)(2k+1) = 0$.",
      "$k^2 + 4k + 4 - 8k - 4 = 0$.",
      "$k^2 - 4k = 0$.",
      "$k(k - 4) = 0 \\Rightarrow k = 0 \\text{ or } k = 4$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "若有等根，判別式 $\\Delta = 0$。",
      "$\\Delta = (k+2)^2 - 4(2k+1) = 0$。",
      "$k^2 + 4k + 4 - 8k - 4 = 0$。",
      "$k^2 - 4k = 0$。",
      "$k(k-4) = 0 \\Rightarrow k = 0$ 或 $k = 4$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_183",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
      "math_geo_coord"
    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "The coordinates of $A$ and $B$ are $(1, 2)$ and $(5, 2)$ respectively. If $P(x, y)$ is a moving point such that $PA = PB$, find the equation of the locus of $P$.",
    "question_zh": "點 $A$ 及 $B$ 的坐標分別為 $(1, 2)$ 及 $(5, 2)$。若 $P(x, y)$ 為一動點使得 $PA = PB$，求 $P$ 的軌跡方程。",
    "options": [
      "A. $x = 3$",
      "B. $y = 3$",
      "C. $x + y = 3$",
      "D. $x - y = 3$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "The locus of point $P$ equidistant from $A$ and $B$ is the perpendicular bisector of $AB$.",
      "$A(1, 2)$ and $B(5, 2)$ lie on the horizontal line $y=2$.",
      "The mid-point of $AB$ is $\\left(\\frac{1+5}{2}, \\frac{2+2}{2}\\right) = (3, 2)$.",
      "The perpendicular bisector must be a vertical line passing through $x=3$.",
      "Equation: $x = 3$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "與 $A$、$B$ 等距的點 $P$ 的軌跡是 $AB$ 的垂直平分線。",
      "$A(1, 2)$ 和 $B(5, 2)$ 位於水平線 $y=2$ 上。",
      "$AB$ 的中點為 $(3, 2)$。",
      "垂直平分線必須是通過 $x=3$ 的鉛垂線。",
      "方程為 $x = 3$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_184",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
      "math_trig_functions"
    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "The period of the function $f(x) = \\sin(kx)$ is $120^\\circ$. Find the value of $k$.",
    "question_zh": "函數 $f(x) = \\sin(kx)$ 的週期為 $120^\\circ$。求 $k$ 的值。",
    "options": [
      "A. 1/3",
      "B. 3",
      "C. 2",
      "D. 6"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "The period of $\\sin(bx)$ is $\\frac{360^\\circ}{b}$.",
      "Given period $= 120^\\circ$.",
      "$120^\\circ = \\frac{360^\\circ}{k} \\Rightarrow k = 3$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "$\\sin(bx)$ 的週期為 $\\frac{360^\\circ}{b}$。",
      "已知週期為 $120^\\circ$。",
      "$120^\\circ = \\frac{360^\\circ}{k} \\Rightarrow k = 3$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_185",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
      "math_stat_prob"
    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "A committee of 3 members is chosen from 5 boys and 4 girls. What is the probability that the committee contains at least one girl?",
    "question_zh": "從 5 名男生和 4 名女生中選出一個 3 人的委員會。問該委員會中至少有一名女生的概率是多少？",
    "options": [
      "A. 5/42",
      "B. 37/42",
      "C. 1/6",
      "D. 5/6"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Total number of ways to choose 3 members from 9 = $C^9_3 = \\frac{9 \\times 8 \\times 7}{3 \\times 2 \\times 1} = 84$.",
      "Using the complement rule: $P(\\text{at least one girl}) = 1 - P(\\text{all boys})$.",
      "Number of ways to choose 3 boys from 5 = $C^5_3 = C^5_2 = 10$.",
      "Probability (all boys) $= 10/84 = 5/42$.",
      "Required probability $= 1 - 5/42 = 37/42$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "從 9 人中選 3 人的總方法數 $= C^9_3 = 84$。",
      "使用餘概率：$P(\\text{至少一女}) = 1 - P(\\text{全男})$。",
      "從 5 男中選 3 男的方法數 $= C^5_3 = 10$。",
      "全男概率 $= 10/84 = 5/42$。",
      "故所求概率 $= 1 - 5/42 = 37/42$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_186",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
      "math_stat_dispersion"
    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "Given a data set with standard deviation $\\sigma$. If each number in the set is multiplied by 3 and then 5 is subtracted, find the new standard deviation.",
    "question_zh": "已知一組數據的標準差為 $\\sigma$。若將組中每個數乘以 3 再減 5，求新的標準差。",
    "options": [
      "A. $3\\sigma - 5$",
      "B. $3\\sigma$",
      "C. $9\\sigma$",
      "D. $\\sigma$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Standard deviation is affected only by multiplication/division, not by addition/subtraction.",
      "If $y_i = ax_i + b$, then $\\sigma_y = |a|\\sigma_x$.",
      "Here $a = 3, b = -5$.",
      "New SD $= 3\\sigma$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "標準差只受乘除影響，不受加減影響。",
      "若 $y_i = ax_i + b$，則 $\\sigma_y = |a|\\sigma_x$。",
      "此處 $a = 3, b = -5$。",
      "新標準差 $= 3\\sigma$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_187",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
