    ],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "In a right pyramid $VABCD$, the base $ABCD$ is a square of side 10 cm. The height of the pyramid is 12 cm.\n(a) Find the length of the slant edge $VA$. (4 marks)\n(b) Find the angle between the slant edge $VA$ and the base $ABCD$. (4 marks)\n(c) Find the angle between the face $VAB$ and the base $ABCD$. (4 marks)",
    "question_zh": "在正四稜錐 $VABCD$ 中，底面 $ABCD$ 是邊長為 10 cm 的正方形。稜錐的高為 12 cm。\n(a) 求斜稜 $VA$ 的長度。(4分)\n(b) 求斜稜 $VA$ 與底面 $ABCD$ 的交角。(4分)\n(c) 求側面 $VAB$ 與底面 $ABCD$ 的交角。(4分)",
    "correct_answer": "VA=13.93cm; Angle(VA,Base)=59.5 deg; Angle(VAB,Base)=67.4 deg",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Let $O$ be the center of the base. Since it's a right pyramid, the height is $VO = 12$.",
      "Distance from $O$ to any vertex of the base (like $A$) is half the diagonal of the square.",
      "Diagonal $AC = \\sqrt{10^2 + 10^2} = 10\\sqrt{2}$. So $OA = 5\\sqrt{2} \\approx 7.071$.",
      "In $\\triangle VOA$, $VA = \\sqrt{VO^2 + OA^2} = \\sqrt{12^2 + (5\\sqrt{2})^2} = \\sqrt{144 + 50} = \\sqrt{194} \\approx 13.93$ cm.",
      "(b) The angle between $VA$ and the base is $\\angle VAO$.",
      "$\\tan(\\angle VAO) = \\frac{VO}{OA} = \\frac{12}{5\\sqrt{2}} \\approx 1.697$.",
      "$\\angle VAO = \\tan^{-1}(1.697) \\approx 59.5^\\circ$.",
      "(c) Let $M$ be the mid-point of $AB$. The required angle is $\\angle VMO$.",
      "$OM = \\text{side}/2 = 5$.",
      "$\\tan(\\angle VMO) = \\frac{VO}{OM} = \\frac{12}{5} = 2.4$.",
      "$\\angle VMO = \\tan^{-1}(2.4) \\approx 67.4^\\circ$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 設 $O$ 為底面中心。$VO = 12$。對角線 $AC = 10\\sqrt{2}$，故 $OA = 5\\sqrt{2}$。",
      "$VA = \\sqrt{12^2 + (5\\sqrt{2})^2} = \\sqrt{194} \\approx 13.93$ cm。",
      "(b) 所求角為 $\\angle VAO$。$\\tan(\\angle VAO) = \\frac{12}{5\\sqrt{2}} \\Rightarrow \\angle VAO \\approx 59.5^\\circ$。",
      "(c) 設 $M$ 為 $AB$ 中點。所求角為 $\\angle VMO$。$OM = 5$。",
      "$\\tan(\\angle VMO) = \\frac{12}{5} = 2.4 \\Rightarrow \\angle VMO \\approx 67.4^\\circ$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved",
